msgctxt "3624"
msgid ""
"So last month, I decided to go see a fortune teller. And you know what's "
"the first thing she said?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3636"
msgid "\"A person of great importance will soon appear in your life...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3648"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3660"
msgid "So when I saw you, all of a sudden, it hit me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3672"
msgid "You're that person, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3684"
msgid "What do you mean by \"a person of great importance\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3696"
msgid "Hmm, good question..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3708"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3720"
msgid "I think that means you're someone who will change my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3732"
msgid "Heh. That's quite the responsibility."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3744"
msgid "Ahaha. Well, don't take it too seriously now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3756"
msgid "Although... That fortune teller does have a pretty good reputation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3768"
msgid "Wouldn't it be funny if her prediction turned out to be true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3780"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3792"
msgid "Is that really accurate?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3804"
msgid "Oh yeah. They say she's never had a false prediction!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3816"
msgid "Must be why she always has a huge line every time I go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3828"
msgid ""
"Even so, most fortunes are vague enough to come true no matter which way "
"you interpret it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3840"
msgid "Well, you're not wrong..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3852"
msgid "Guess you don't believe in that stuff, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3864"
msgid ""
"...You know, it probably wouldn't hurt to be a little more adventurous. "
"Otherwise you'll live a boring life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3876"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3888"
msgid ""
"Now that you mention it, I feel the same way. Maybe it's fate that we're "
"sitting here like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3900"
msgid "You mean it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3912"
msgid "Of course. Anyone would say the same if they met such a great woman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3924"
msgid "Hehe. You're such a flirt, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3936"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3948"
msgid "Hey, but what if what that fortune teller said was true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3960"
msgid ""
"She does have a pretty good reputation, after all. Maybe we really were "
"meant to be!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3972"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3984"
msgid "Kiryu-san, have you ever worn a \"bingata\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3996"
msgid "I don't even know what that is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4008"
msgid ""
"I had a feeling you'd say that. So, a bingata is basically an Okinawan "
"kimono, but with a couple differences. Bright colors, tropical designs, "
"unique dyes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4020"
msgid ""
"Anyway, my family's been making bingatas since waaaay back. My "
"great-grandpa made the one that's hanging up here, as a matter of fact."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4032"
msgid "Hey, that's impressive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4044"
msgid "Isn't it? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4056"
msgid ""
"Bingatas are a part of Okinawa's traditional culture! You should try one on "
"when you get the chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4068"
msgid "Kimonos are great, aren't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4080"
msgid "They are! How often do you wear one, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4092"
msgid "Oh, I've only worn one a handful of times."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4104"
msgid ""
"Hmm, maybe consider doing it more often. Even the simpler ones can make you "
"feel elegant, and if you take good care of them, they'll last you a "
"lifetime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4116"
msgid "That's true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4128"
msgid ""
"Plus, if a kimono gets worn out, you could always just turn it into a "
"yukata. Then you can have fun re-dyeing it however you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4140"
msgid ""
"With that kind of versatility, you could take one that you got from your "
"grandparents, wear it, and it'd still be priceless. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4152"
msgid "I see... That would come in pretty handy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4164"
msgid "Show me how to wear one sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4176"
msgid ""
"Okay. You are my \"person of great importance\" after all. ♪\r\n"
"Maybe that's not all I'll end up showing you.\r\n"
"Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4188"
msgid ""
"In all seriousness, if you do come visit my house, you'd better be "
"prepared. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4200"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4212"
msgid ""
"For starters, my nana's gonna want to come meet ya. Then she'll make a big "
"ol' fuss about something and, before the night is done, everyone'll end up "
"drunk. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4224"
msgid "That... doesn't sound entirely bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4236"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well, if I told the family you're a man of great importance, they "
"might not let you leave. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4248"
msgid "Heh. Sounds like they care about you a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4260"
msgid "It must be difficult to keep that tradition alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4272"
msgid "...Yeah, kind of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4284"
msgid ""
"I guess that's just how it is with some things. Not everyone has interest "
"in learning about their roots."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4296"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4308"
msgid ""
"...You're right. Sometimes it's like I'm doing all this in a vacuum, and I "
"wonder if it'll ever be passed on to the future generations at all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4320"
msgid "...Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4332"
msgid "Oh, no... It's nothing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4344"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4356"
msgid "So my nana had her birthday the other day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4368"
msgid "Oh, congratulations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4380"
msgid "How old is she?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4392"
msgid "She's seventy-nine years young!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4404"
msgid "That's great. Hope she stays happy and healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4416"
msgid ""
"Oh, she will. She's full of energy now, and believe me, she's got plenty "
"left in the tank."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4428"
msgid "I would know, 'cause she practically raised me all by herself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4440"
msgid "Is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4452"
msgid ""
"Yeah. My dad had a terminal illness, and he died right before I started "
"elementary school..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4464"
msgid ""
"From then on, my mom took over the family bingata business, and she was "
"hardly ever at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4476"
msgid "I haven't really talked to my mom since then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4488"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4500"
msgid "So yeah. My nana deserves nothing but the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4512"
msgid "Okinawa is known for its high life expectancy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4524"
msgid "I'm sure she'll enjoy her golden years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4536"
msgid "Heh, so you know about that, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4548"
msgid ""
"The average lifespan of women in Okinawa is still among the highest in the "
"world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4560"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4572"
msgid "Do you still not get along with your mother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4584"
msgid ""
"Mm, it's not that we don't get along... It's more like we never established "
"a relationship to begin with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4596"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4608"
msgid ""
"She's always been absorbed in her work, so whenever I try talking to her, "
"she hardly gives me a response. It's been this way forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4620"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4632"
msgid "Guess you're a grandma's girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4644"
msgid "...Pretty much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4656"
msgid ""
"My nana's always been there for me, no matter what the situation. As a "
"caretaker and as a friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4668"
msgid "That's special."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4680"
msgid "Yup. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Don't know what I would've done without her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4692"
msgid "With any luck, she'll keep on kicking way past a hundred!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4704"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4716"
msgid ""
"Hey, what do you think when you hear someone speak standard Japanese? You "
"know, the Tokyo dialect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4728"
msgid "Not sure. I hear it all the time, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4740"
msgid ""
"Well, to me, it gives off this sophisticated sort of vibe. Like you're from "
"the center of civilization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4752"
msgid ""
"And no matter how cool someone is, it always sounds a little funny when "
"they let out a word or a phrase that only a local would say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4764"
msgid ""
"So yeah. Seeing a strong, handsome guy like you speaking standard Japanese "
"is really impressive. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4776"
msgid "Kinda gets my heart racing. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4788"
msgid "I actually admire those local dialects."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4800"
msgid "Oh, really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4812"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4824"
msgid ""
"Well, it's true that local dialects give off a unique sense of warmth, or "
"at the very least, provide context. But in my case, I'm better off hiding "
"it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4836"
msgid "Don't worry. You can be yourself around me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4848"
msgid ""
"Oh no. The moment I say something Okinawan, you'll think I'm a total "
"country girl!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4860"
msgid "Heh. There's nothing wrong with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4872"
msgid "\"Hakuna matata.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4884"
msgid ""
"Ahahaha! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Kiryu-san! That's not Okinawan at all! I "
"think you meant, \"nankurunaisa!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4896"
msgid ""
"I guess I should give you some credit. Both of those phrases do have a "
"similar meaning: \"It'll all work out.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4908"
msgid "Right... I knew that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4920"
msgid "...You should probably stick to standard Japanese, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4932"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4944"
msgid "So you like the way I talk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4956"
msgid "Maybe just a little. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4968"
msgid ""
"But if you were to whisper in my ear with that gentle voice of yours... I "
"might just faint with pleasure. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4980"
msgid "Heh. I wonder what I should whisper, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4992"
msgid "What kind of guys do you like, Nao?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5004"
msgid "Huh? Where's this coming from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5016"
msgid "Oh, I was just curious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5028"
msgid "Hmm. Not really sure if I have an answer for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5040"
msgid "I mean... I never really got to know any of the guys I dated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5052"
msgid "We always broke up before I could figure them out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5064"
msgid "So, I probably don't have a type. Or if I do, I have no clue what it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5076"
msgid "How is that possible?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5088"
msgid ""
"The thing is, it takes me forever to decide whether I really like a guy or "
"not. So by the time I figure that out, it's usually several months into a "
"relationship."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5100"
msgid ""
"Maybe if I knew how to be more upfront with guys instead of letting them "
"pull me into their life, I'd have a better idea of what I want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5112"
msgid "...That makes me sound kind of pathetic, doesn't it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5124"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5136"
msgid "Is it hard for you to reject guys or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5148"
msgid "It is! I just feel so bad letting them down..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5160"
msgid "I'm sure being popular doesn't help, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5172"
msgid "Haha, I wish! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5184"
msgid "I'm so unpopular with guys, it's almost scary."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5196"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5208"
msgid ""
"Does that mean you'd go out with a guy even if you weren't sure you liked "
"him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5220"
msgid "...Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5232"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5244"
msgid ""
"I hope they don't feel like I'm leading them on. That would be really bad, "
"huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5256"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5268"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5280"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5292"
msgid "This is kinda embarrassing, but could I ask you something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5304"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5316"
msgid "What kind of place is Tokyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5328"
msgid "It's full of people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5340"
msgid "Ohh, so it's true!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5352"
msgid "Yeah. It's crowded pretty much anywhere you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5364"
msgid ""
"Then how do people walk around without bumping into each other? Especially "
"in places like, let's say, Shibuya Crossing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5376"
msgid "I bet it's fun to go people watching over there. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5388"
msgid "Heh. Maybe so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5400"
msgid ""
"I gotta say, even hearing something small like that about Tokyo gets me "
"really pumped up to go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5412"
msgid "Hope I can take a vacation sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5424"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5436"
msgid "It's full of beautiful women."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5448"
msgid "Oh yeah? What about handsome guys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5460"
msgid "There's plenty of those, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5472"
msgid "Guess that's just life in the big city. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5484"
msgid "But on the other hand..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5496"
msgid "That makes me feel less confident about where I live."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5508"
msgid ""
"Like, I'm sure everyone in Tokyo knows all about the latest trends... Heck, "
"they set those trends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5520"
msgid "I'm sure there are plenty of fashionable people in Okinawa, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5532"
msgid ""
"Haha, unfortunately, I don't think we hold a candle to Tokyo\r\n"
"when it comes to setting trends. Guess that's how it goes.\r\n"
"Haha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5544"
msgid "Oh! But maybe it works the other way, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5556"
msgid ""
"If I went over to Tokyo, maybe I can be the one who makes the next big "
"thing! And achieve all my dreams, and stuff! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5568"
msgid "Heh, you never know until you try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5580"
msgid "Ahh, just hearing about Tokyo gets me all pumped up to go..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5592"
msgid "Hope I can take a vacation sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5604"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5616"
msgid "It's full of dangerous people with twisted intentions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5628"
msgid "Dang... I had hoped that wouldn't be true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5640"
msgid ""
"Women just coming in from the countryside are especially vulnerable "
"targets. It's like every other person's a scammer or a criminal these "
"days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5652"
msgid "What's so bad about Okinawa that makes you want to leave?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5664"
msgid ""
"Oh, no, it's not like I want to leave this place behind and never look "
"back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5676"
msgid ""
"But I think anyone from around here would want to experience a different "
"way of life, at least once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5688"
msgid "...Or maybe that just goes to show how little I know about the world..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5700"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5712"
msgid "So everyone's been talking about gemstones lately."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5724"
msgid "Gemstones?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5736"
msgid "You know, like amethyst and turquoise? They're precious, they're pretty..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5748"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5760"
msgid ""
"Anyway, each one has a different purpose. You can tell by the color and the "
"pattern."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5772"
msgid "And when you put one on your body, you can tap into some of its power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5784"
msgid "Interesting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5796"
msgid "Oh, but they're kind of expensive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5808"
msgid "That much doesn't surprise me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5820"
msgid "Yeah... Still doesn't stop me from wanting one, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5832"
msgid "Then I'll buy all the stones you want."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5844"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5856"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5868"
msgid "I guess it did kinda sound like I was asking. Sorry it came across that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5880"
msgid "That's okay. No need to be so modest about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5892"
msgid "No, seriously. I appreciate the offer, but that really wasn't my intention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5904"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5916"
msgid "What kind of powers do they come with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5928"
msgid "Well, like I said, it all depends on the stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5940"
msgid ""
"For example, my favorite, the aquamarine, is said to soothe both mind and "
"body."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5952"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5964"
msgid ""
"It also \"helps you have a happy marriage,\" or at least that's what they "
"say. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5976"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5988"
msgid "I'd like one of these gemstones myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6000"
msgid "Oh really? You'd actually wear one? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6012"
msgid "Yeah, why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6024"
msgid "Okay, then what sort of power are you looking for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6036"
msgid "...More health?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6048"
msgid ""
"Ahaha, is that right? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> But you already look so "
"healthy, I doubt you'd actually need it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6060"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6072"
msgid "*sigh* I just can't get it out of my head..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6084"
msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6096"
msgid ""
"Mm, it feels like I haven't been doing it enough. It's like, no matter how "
"much love and attention I give it, it's never moist and happy like it "
"usually is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6108"
msgid "At this rate, I'm worried it'll dry out completely..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6120"
msgid "I can help with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6132"
msgid "Really!? Okay, what should I do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6144"
msgid "Well... I can put the moisture back in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6156"
msgid "Huh? You can? How?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6168"
msgid "What I'm saying is, you and I... can make the moisture happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6180"
msgid "You and I...? How's that supposed to work?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6192"
msgid "Ohhh... I think we're having an entirely different conversation here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6204"
msgid "...We are?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6216"
msgid "Yeah, you big perv. I was talking about watering one of my plants back home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6228"
msgid "...Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6240"
msgid "Are you saying you're lonely?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6252"
msgid "Hmm, I guess you could say that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6264"
msgid "You guess?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6276"
msgid "Yeah. I mean, I do give it a good rinse before and after I leave for work..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6288"
msgid "Maybe it just needs to be fertilized?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6300"
msgid "...Fertilized how?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6312"
msgid ""
"That's the thing. The guy at the gardening shop told me it wouldn't require "
"any sort of special care. That's the only reason I decided to take it home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6324"
msgid "Wait, are you saying your plant is the one that's in danger of drying out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6336"
msgid "What else would I be talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6348"
msgid ""
"It's called lucky bamboo, but its scientific name is <Italic>Dracaena "
"sanderiana</Italic>. And it's got the cutest leaves, too! Makes the other "
"bamboo species look like overgrown bushes. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6360"
msgid "...Uh-huh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6372"
msgid "You haven't met anyone good... that can satisfy your needs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6384"
msgid "Satisfy my needs? What the heck? Are you saying I should consult a gardener?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6396"
msgid "No... unless that's what you're into..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6408"
msgid "Waaaait a minute..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6420"
msgid "Ahaha, now I get it. So that's where your mind was going."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6432"
msgid "Oh Kiryu-san... What am I gonna do with you? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6444"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6456"
msgid "I was talking about my plant back home. It's almost dry as a bone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6468"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6480"
msgid ""
"Haha, you don't have to hide it, Kiryu-san! Well, at least you were "
"concerned about me. ♪ That's something to be happy about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6492"
msgid "You know me. Always happy to help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6504"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6516"
msgid "Somebody asked me out. It was only a friend of a friend, but still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6528"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6540"
msgid ""
"We'd been going out together as a group recently, but I guess he started "
"liking me at some point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6552"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6564"
msgid ""
"And while I appreciate the fact he's into me, I'm not really sure how to "
"handle this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6576"
msgid "Do you like him to begin with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6588"
msgid "...I'm honestly not sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6600"
msgid "Maybe I should let him know that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6612"
msgid "That might be a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6624"
msgid "Mm... Sorry for bringing up such a weird topic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6636"
msgid "You're fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6648"
msgid "...Guess I need to give it a bit more thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6660"
msgid "Never hurts to do so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6672"
msgid "If you don't like the guy, don't date him. No need to force yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6684"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6696"
msgid "Is it that you're worried what your friends might think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6708"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6720"
msgid "That won't help you make a good decision."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6732"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6744"
msgid "...Maybe I shouldn't have brought this up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6756"
msgid "It's fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6768"
msgid "I will give it a bit more thought, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6780"
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6792"
msgid "Why don't you wait a bit more? See how you really feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6804"
msgid "Wouldn't it be bad to make him wait, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6816"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6828"
msgid ""
"If he can't put his feelings on hold for you, then they weren't true to "
"begin with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6840"
msgid "Mm. That makes a lot of sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6852"
msgid ""
"What's the point of giving him an answer I'm not comfortable with? It's "
"better to just be sincere. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6864"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6876"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Thanks, Kiryu-san. You know how to give "
"advice. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6888"
msgid "Heh. I try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6900"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san. Have you ever looked at someone and been reminded of someone you "
"lost?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6912"
msgid "...All the time, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6924"
msgid ""
"I was gonna say, looking at you reminds me of my dad. He was probably "
"around your age when he passed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6936"
msgid "...Sorry if this is coming out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6948"
msgid "It's okay. We can talk about it if you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6960"
msgid "Mmkay. Well, when I was little, I'd often visit his workshop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6972"
msgid ""
"Dad would always stop and listen to whatever I had to say. Didn't matter "
"what he was doing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6984"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6996"
msgid ""
"He'd do stuff like make origami with me, or if I was being fussy, he'd put "
"me on his lap and start reading me a book."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7008"
msgid ""
"Both he and my mom would always be smiling and laughing... At least that's "
"what I remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7020"
msgid "Sounds like you had a great father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7032"
msgid ""
"He was the best dad a girl could have! ♪ Even when I was being a total "
"brat, he never seemed to lose his temper. Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7044"
msgid "Heh. He must've really enjoyed seeing you happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7056"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7068"
msgid "Yeah... Too bad those days are never coming back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7080"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7092"
msgid "You're lucky to even have parents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7104"
msgid "I grew up in a orphanage, so I never knew mine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7116"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7128"
msgid "I had no idea..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7140"
msgid ""
"Sorry I just blurted things out without thinking. You must be feeling "
"terrible right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7152"
msgid "No need to apologize. I'm fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7164"
msgid "It's no use dwelling on the past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7176"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7188"
msgid "No matter how much you look back, it won't change the present."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7200"
msgid "You're right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7212"
msgid "Now, I won't say I'm an expert on how to deal with family issues..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7224"
msgid "But maybe it's more important to take care of your own situation first?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7236"
msgid "...Maybe so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7248"
msgid "And if there's anything I can help you with, you can always tell me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7260"
msgid "Thanks, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7272"
msgid "Hearing that from you is reassuring. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7284"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7296"
msgid "Kiryu-san, have you ever been to Fukuoka?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7308"
msgid "No, why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7320"
msgid "It's where my dad is from, so I wanted to know what sort of place it was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7332"
msgid "Helps you feel connected, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7344"
msgid ""
"Yeah. My dad's side of the family was known for weaving hakata-ori fabrics. "
"It's one of Fukuoka's traditional crafts."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7356"
msgid "Ah. Did not know that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7368"
msgid ""
"From what my nana told me, my dad was supposed to inherit the family "
"business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7380"
msgid ""
"But after he met my mom and discovered the joys of making bingata, he "
"decided to build his life here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7392"
msgid ""
"And you know what his parents said? Nothing. They disowned him and left it "
"at that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7404"
msgid "That's harsh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7416"
msgid ""
"Now, I've never been to Fukuoka, and there's a lot I don't know about my "
"dad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7428"
msgid ""
"But if I want to keep his memory alive, I need to learn more about him. So "
"I want to travel there someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7440"
msgid "Sounds like he was really dedicated, to both your mother and bingata."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7452"
msgid "...He was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7464"
msgid "Makes me wonder what I'm doing with my life..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7476"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7488"
msgid ""
"I'm always going on about how much I love my dad, or how much I wanna go "
"back to the way things were..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7500"
msgid ""
"But all I keep doing is distancing myself from my mom, and the bingata that "
"my dad fell in love with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7512"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7524"
msgid "...Sorry for being so depressing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7536"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7548"
msgid "You should visit your relatives sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7560"
msgid "You think that'd be okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7572"
msgid "There shouldn't be a problem. You are their granddaughter, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7584"
msgid "That's true. No point in overthinking it, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7596"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7608"
msgid "Just you wait, Fukuoka... I'll be standing on your soil soon enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7620"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7632"
msgid "That almost sounds like something out of a soap opera."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7644"
msgid "...That's the first thing that popped into your head?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7656"
msgid "Yeah. So what happened after he got disowned?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7668"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Is this a joke to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7680"
msgid "No, not at all. I was just lightening the mood."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7692"
msgid ""
"Well I didn't ask for that. I'm telling you something from my heart, and "
"you treat it like a TV show... So rude."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7704"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7716"
msgid "What's your ideal household, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7728"
msgid "...Hmm, I'm not sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7740"
msgid ""
"In my case, I would love it if I didn't have to work. I'd just sit around "
"and clean up the house, most likely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7752"
msgid "Of course, I wouldn't want my kids to be lonely either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7764"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7776"
msgid ""
"I'd want to able to kneel down, look them in the eyes, and tell them how "
"precious they are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7788"
msgid ""
"And the dad would love our kids, our kids would love their dad, and they'd "
"have so much fun together, even I'd get a little jealous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7800"
msgid "I think I can visualize that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7812"
msgid ""
"I'd want them to grow up respecting their parents, and never have to feel "
"alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7824"
msgid "Sounds like an ideal household."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7836"
msgid "Doesn't it? I'd be so happy if I could have that kind of family one day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7848"
msgid ""
"If you were the dad, Kiryu-san, I'm sure the kids would\r\n"
" love you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7860"
msgid "Heh. I hope so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7872"
msgid "You must have been pretty lonely growing up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7884"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7896"
msgid "Is that where all this is coming from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7908"
msgid "...Yeah. It's just as you said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7920"
msgid "But is it so wrong to want that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7932"
msgid "No. Not at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7944"
msgid "You probably think it's impossible for me, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7956"
msgid "*sob* That hurts..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7968"
msgid "(...What do I say?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7980"
msgid "Children do grow up watching their parents..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7992"
msgid "But you don't always have to be by their side."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8004"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8016"
msgid "However, having them see the smile on your face will always be important."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8028"
msgid "You're right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8040"
msgid ""
"They're gonna have to leave the nest at some point, and by then, you'd want "
"them to be able to stand on their own two feet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8052"
msgid ""
"Even so, a happy home full of love is the ideal place to\r\n"
"grow up. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8064"
msgid "Heh... You're absolutely right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8076"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8088"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8100"
msgid "Is everything okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8112"
msgid "Oh... Yeah. It's just that I have a lot going on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8124"
msgid "Then let's talk. That's a lot better than keeping it inside, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8136"
msgid "Haha, then I'll take you up on your offer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8148"
msgid "So, I heard this from one of my friends..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8160"
msgid "Apparently my family's been in debt for a number of years now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8172"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8184"
msgid ""
"My mom's been working hard to clear it all by herself, and I never knew a "
"thing about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8196"
msgid "Try not to blame yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8208"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8220"
msgid "I'm sure she just didn't want to make you worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8232"
msgid ""
"My mom's always been like that... Working herself to the bone, without "
"asking anyone's assistance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8244"
msgid "Well, if there's anything I can do to help, let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8256"
msgid "I appreciate that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8268"
msgid "Just you being here is enough, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8280"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8292"
msgid "Are you gonna be okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8304"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8316"
msgid "If there's anything I can do to help, let me know. I'm here for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8328"
msgid "...I appreciate that, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8340"
msgid "But this has been going on for a long time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8352"
msgid "And the fact that I knew nothing... hurts me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8364"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8376"
msgid "I'm sure she's been going through a lot."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8388"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8400"
msgid ""
"My mom's always been like that. She would work herself to the bone without "
"asking for any assistance..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8412"
msgid "But it's been hard for me too, Kiryu-san. I've been ignorant all this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8424"
msgid "I'm so ashamed of myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8436"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8448"
msgid "Kiryu-san, are you the type who gets all affectionate when you're in love?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8460"
msgid "Heh, now there's a question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8472"
msgid "What do you think I am?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8484"
msgid "I'm guessing you're the affectionate type?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8496"
msgid "Nope. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8508"
msgid "I'm the type who plays hard-to-get. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8520"
msgid "Do you now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8532"
msgid ""
"Yup. It's hard for me to be affectionate with a partner, so I let them do "
"the work instead. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8544"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8556"
msgid "Sometimes I wonder if that's really okay, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8568"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8580"
msgid ""
"It feels like I'm relying on the other person to make all the moves... "
"Which, in turn, decides the relationship."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8592"
msgid "And that's no good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8604"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8616"
msgid "Are you saying that's a good thing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8628"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8640"
msgid ""
"I mean, you go out with people without knowing whether you like them or "
"not..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8652"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8664"
msgid ""
"Right, you're saying that since I don't know how I feel about them, that's "
"why I can't be affectionate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8676"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8688"
msgid "Man, I really am no good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8700"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8712"
msgid "What about me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8724"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8736"
msgid "Why don't you be affectionate with me? Since you're that type and all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8748"
msgid "Ohhh! Ahahaha! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8760"
msgid "Okay then, what do you want me to do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8772"
msgid "Can I use your lap as a pillow?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8784"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Save that for when we get to know each "
"other a little better. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8796"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8808"
msgid "So, I went out with a guy from Tokyo before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8820"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8832"
msgid ""
"The company he worked at had an office in Okinawa, so he came to the club "
"pretty often whenever he was here on business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8844"
msgid "I actually had a thing for him, and he said he liked me, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8856"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8868"
msgid "But when the business trip was done, he would just go back home..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8880"
msgid "It went on like that for half a year, but I just couldn't bear it any more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8892"
msgid "It wasn't his fault either. He did have a job and all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8904"
msgid ""
"It was hard for the both of us, and we both knew it. I don't think I could "
"survive a long-distance relationship if that's how it's gonna be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8916"
msgid "That's how it goes sometimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8928"
msgid "I guess so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8940"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8952"
msgid "If you were in my situation, would you feel the same way?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8964"
msgid "Let's see... That's a tough question."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8976"
msgid "I bet you'd wait patiently for your lover. You seem like that kind of guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8988"
msgid "No, I'm pretty hopeless when it comes to that sort of thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9000"
msgid ""
"You say that now, but you'd probably wait forever if it was me. Right? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9012"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9024"
msgid "Do you still think about him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9036"
msgid ""
"No, we're already over and done with. I don't want to drag it on longer "
"than I already have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9048"
msgid "But now that I think of it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9060"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9072"
msgid ""
"I don't have the confidence to go through another long-distance "
"relationship like that again. Just the idea of it is making me cringe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9084"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9096"
msgid "You didn't want to chase after him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9108"
msgid "...No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9120"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9132"
msgid "I mean, maybe deep down, I did..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9144"
msgid ""
"But I was so afraid of what would happen, I just couldn't bring myself to "
"do it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9156"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9168"
msgid "So! I got my fortune told today. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9180"
msgid "By the same fortune teller as before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9192"
msgid "Yeah, she got me pretty hooked after the first time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9204"
msgid "So! Question for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9216"
msgid "What kind of reading did she give me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9228"
msgid "Something to do with relationships?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9240"
msgid "Bzzt! Wrong. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9252"
msgid ""
"Kind of funny that you mention that, though. I usually seek relationship "
"advice, but not this time around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9264"
msgid "I'm more interested in finding out about my future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9276"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9288"
msgid "Was it about your finances?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9300"
msgid "Ding ding ding! ♪ You're amazing, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9312"
msgid "What in particular did you want to know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9324"
msgid ""
"Don't laugh, but I wanted to know if I was gonna win the lottery or "
"something. I was thinking of remodeling the house, but to do that, I'm "
"gonna need some extra cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9336"
msgid "Heh. Yeah, you'll probably need a lot of extra cash for something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9348"
msgid ""
"Mhm. Only thing is, the lady ended up telling me, \"How should I know "
"that!?\" It's like, come on, you're a fortune teller here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9360"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9372"
msgid "Maybe something to do with life in general?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9384"
msgid "Life? You mean how long I would live?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9396"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9408"
msgid "Didn't we talk about how long women in Okinawa live?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9420"
msgid "So I don't need to worry about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9432"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9444"
msgid "Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9456"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9468"
msgid "Will you hear me out without judging me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9480"
msgid "Sure. What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9492"
msgid "I, um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9504"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9516"
msgid "I love smelling things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9528"
msgid "Heh. That's cool, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9540"
msgid "Oh? You're not weirded out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9552"
msgid ""
"No, in fact I think it's fine to enjoy the sense of smell. Human beings are "
"built that way, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9564"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank goodness somebody gets it. ♪ I knew you'd see things my way. "
"Everyone else I know would probably look at me like I'm gross."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9576"
msgid "Heh. I guess it all depends on how you phrase it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9588"
msgid ""
"Let me put it to you this way. I have this habit of sniffing everything... "
"flowers, food, shampoo, clothes, you name it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9600"
msgid ""
"Sometimes I'll smell something I really like and smile to myself out of "
"nowhere. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9612"
msgid "Is smelling something really that much fun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9624"
msgid ""
"Yes it is. ♪ I consider myself a diehard smell enthusiast. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9636"
msgid "...Interesting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9648"
msgid "What, you find that weird all of a sudden?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9660"
msgid "No, not at all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9672"
msgid "What's your favorite smell?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9684"
msgid "Hmm. I can't narrow it down to anything specific."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9696"
msgid ""
"But whenever I encounter a scent I like, I get goosebumps. Like, it really "
"makes me happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9708"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9720"
msgid "Does that make me weird...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9732"
msgid "No, not at all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9744"
msgid "How about my smell? Here, take a whiff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9756"
msgid "Are you sure? Hehehe... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9768"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9780"
msgid "Hehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9792"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9804"
msgid ""
"On second thought, it's kind of embarrassing to do that in the club, so "
"maybe let's save that for another time. Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9816"
msgid "Heh. Looking forward to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9828"
msgid "Do you remember when we talked about plants?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9840"
msgid "How could I forget?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9852"
msgid "Well apparently, it didn't have good feng shui."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9864"
msgid "...It didn't have fun doing what now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9876"
msgid ""
"Feng shui, Kiryu-san. I was reading this magazine, and there was an article "
"about how to rearrange your house in order to maximize your luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9888"
msgid ""
"If you put a plant somewhere that doesn't have a good flow of chi, it'll "
"weaken and start withering..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9900"
msgid ""
"So when I tested it out and moved where it was supposed to be, it came back "
"to life like magic. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9912"
msgid "Really now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9924"
msgid ""
"Yeah. The article was full of interesting stuff, like how you're supposed "
"to give your partner a sapphire if you want to keep them from cheating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9936"
msgid "Feng shui can be pretty fun, once you get it down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9948"
msgid "Unbelievable..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9960"
msgid ""
"It's 100％ true! My plant really is doing much better. I can send you a "
"picture to prove it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9972"
msgid "But it could just be coincidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9984"
msgid "Well, when you put it like that, there's not much more I can say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9996"
msgid "Oh. Sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10008"
msgid "Prevent cheating, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10020"
msgid "Hehe, yeah, and apparently it works like a charm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10032"
msgid "Really..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10044"
msgid "But if I were going out with you, I wouldn't give you one at first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10056"
msgid "I'd wait till after you cheat. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10068"
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10080"
msgid ""
"Well, I'd want you to stop cheating out of your own volition, not 'cause I "
"gave you some stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10092"
msgid "Wouldn't you feel the same way? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10104"
msgid "Yeah, I guess so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10116"
msgid "I'm glad your plant is better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10128"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> The leaves are green and perky "
"again. ♪ Guess that means Sandy's finally happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10140"
msgid "Sandy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10152"
msgid ""
"Yeah. My plant's a <Italic>Dracaena sanderiana</Italic>, so I named it "
"Sandy. Fitting, right? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10164"
msgid "Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10176"
msgid "So my friend threw a nabe party the other day. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10188"
msgid ""
"She's from Kyushu, so she made it chanko-style. And let me tell you, it was "
"some serious stew. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10200"
msgid ""
"We don't do a lot of nabe here in Okinawa, so I practically gorged myself. "
"Gotta get it while the getting's good! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10212"
msgid "Right on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10224"
msgid "But the nabe had something in it that I absolutely cannot stand..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10236"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10248"
msgid "...Shiitake mushrooms."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10260"
msgid "Heh. Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10272"
msgid "Yes, really! Shiitakes are disgusting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10284"
msgid ""
"They're slimy, they're squishy, and whenever you bite into them, this "
"rancid, sweaty, sock flavor starts seeping into your mouth! Yuck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10296"
msgid "I can't understand how people eat those fungi... funguses... whatever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10308"
msgid "You hate it that much, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10320"
msgid "Uh-huh! Big, meaty shiitake, I especially can't do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10332"
msgid ""
"I mean, I can probably choke it down if it's chopped up too small for me to "
"notice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10344"
msgid "But if I even see the shape, then no. It's barf city from there on out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10356"
msgid "Huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10368"
msgid "Do you hate other mushrooms too? How about matsutake, for example?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10380"
msgid "Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I love matsutake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10392"
msgid "How does that work..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10404"
msgid ""
"It's a totally different mushroom, Kiryu-san. Matsutakes are smooth and "
"silky, their shape is strong and sturdy... They're good enough to gobble in "
"one bite!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10416"
msgid "Oh, and the smell. It has such a lovely smell. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10428"
msgid "But it is a fungus, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10440"
msgid ""
"Yeeeaaah, I know, but all things considered, isn't it a little like a "
"bamboo shoot?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10452"
msgid "If you say so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10464"
msgid "Not all funguses are bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10476"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10488"
msgid ""
"Take natto and cheese, for example. Those are made by mold, which is a type "
"of fungus."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10500"
msgid "Well... I see your point, but... Ehhh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10512"
msgid ""
"I guess when something makes an impression on you, that's it. Your "
"opinion's set in stone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10524"
msgid "Mm, I get that a lot. Not exactly in those words..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10536"
msgid "But hey, I like what I like, and vice versa. Can't blame me for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10548"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10560"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10572"
msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10584"
msgid ""
"Nothing... I was just thinking how nice it is to have good friends in your "
"life. Made me tear up a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10596"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10608"
msgid "My friends knew how hard my family's been struggling..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10620"
msgid "And three of them even ordered bingata as their way of helping..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10632"
msgid "They really helped you out, didn't they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10644"
msgid "Yes. I'm grateful to have met such wonderful people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10656"
msgid "But still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10668"
msgid ""
"I feel bad that they went out of their way to do this... All because I "
"failed to realize what was happening..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10680"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10692"
msgid "You've got some great friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10704"
msgid "I sure do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10716"
msgid "And the way they told me about it was so pure and honest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10728"
msgid ""
"It wasn't out of obligation, or to guilt trip me, or anything like that... "
"That's what made me cry even more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10740"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10752"
msgid "That's what friends are for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10764"
msgid "You need to repay them sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10776"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10788"
msgid "But honestly, what can I do for them? I don't have that kind of money..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10800"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10812"
msgid "So, remember that guy who asked me out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10824"
msgid "I ended up turning him down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10836"
msgid "Ah. So he finally has an answer now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10848"
msgid "Yeah. I really had to give it some thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10860"
msgid "But I'm glad I talked to you about it first. Thanks, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10872"
msgid "As long as you don't regret it, then I think you did the right thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10884"
msgid "Yeah. Plus, it'd be bad for the both of us if I lied about my feelings."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10896"
msgid "And when I told him that, he was satisfied with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10908"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10920"
msgid "What was your reason for turning him down, if you don't mind me asking?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10932"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10944"
msgid "It's because there's someone else I like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10956"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10968"
msgid "A very wonderful person, in fact. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10980"
msgid "Wonder who that could be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10992"
msgid "Is the situation still bothering you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11004"
msgid "Yeah. It is the first time I've turned someone down like this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11016"
msgid ""
"The worst part came when I saw the look on his face. I knew he was "
"devastated, yet he was trying so hard to seem cool about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11028"
msgid "I don't think you should worry too much about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11040"
msgid "I know... I should be more confident in myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11052"
msgid "You have every reason to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11064"
msgid "Hehehehe... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11076"
msgid "What's so funny?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11088"
msgid "I couldn't help it, Kiryu-san! I went and bought me a gemstone! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11100"
msgid "Ooh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11112"
msgid "Sure, I had to spend some of the money I've been saving..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11124"
msgid ""
"But now happiness should come to me twice as quick! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11136"
msgid "I'm sure happiness will find its way to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11148"
msgid "Ahaha! ♪ You really think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11160"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11172"
msgid ""
"Okay, then once I've achieved max happiness, I'll share some of that power "
"with you. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11184"
msgid "Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11196"
msgid "Don't get your hopes up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11208"
msgid "What!? Kiryu-san, why would you say something so cruel..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11220"
msgid ""
"Don't take this the wrong way, but you seem like an impressionable person. "
"And I don't think relying on some random rock will help you achieve your "
"goals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11232"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11244"
msgid "You didn't have to come down on me that hard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11256"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11268"
msgid "What a waste."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11280"
msgid "Wha...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11292"
msgid "How much was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11304"
msgid "Why does it matter how much it was?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11316"
msgid "I mean, it's something that made me happy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11328"
msgid "You probably wouldn't understand even if I told you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11340"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11352"
msgid "I've been struggling with something my nana told me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11364"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11376"
msgid "She said to forgive my mom..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11388"
msgid "Mm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11400"
msgid ""
"She told me to try and see it from my mom's perspective... That she's been "
"working hard not just for me, but for my dad, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11412"
msgid "Your nana is absolutely right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11424"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11436"
msgid "Try not to dwell on it too much. That won't help you any."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11448"
msgid "Why don't you try speaking to your mom sometime?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11460"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11472"
msgid "Can I really get through to her...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11484"
msgid "Yeah. I'm sure you two can reach an understanding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11496"
msgid "Then you know what you have to do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11508"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11520"
msgid ""
"But I'm scared of what she'll say to me after all this time. What if she "
"completely rejects me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11532"
msgid "I doubt that would actually happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11544"
msgid "In fact, talking to her might be easier than you think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11556"
msgid "You really think so...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11568"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11580"
msgid "...Thanks for your vote of confidence, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11592"
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11604"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11616"
msgid "Just be honest with her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11628"
msgid "I would, if she'd actually let me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11640"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11652"
msgid "I do know what you're saying, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11664"
msgid ""
"Despite that, everything I tried has failed so far. So I can't hope for "
"much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11676"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11688"
msgid "Kiryu-san, you have to help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11700"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11712"
msgid "Loan sharks started showing up at our house, demanding money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11724"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11736"
msgid ""
"We already paid back the principal, but apparently the interest isn't "
"matching up with what we had agreed on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11748"
msgid "You mean you got tricked somehow?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11760"
msgid " We might have..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11772"
msgid ""
"Let me know immediately if you run into trouble. I'll be there in a "
"heartbeat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11784"
msgid " Thanks, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11796"
msgid "But I don't want to be a burden on you... This is my problem to solve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11808"
msgid ""
"You're not a burden at all. Consider me as just another friend who wants to "
"help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11820"
msgid "Is that really okay, though? I feel like I've asked too much already..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11832"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11844"
msgid "They're not being violent with you, are they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11856"
msgid "No, thank goodness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11868"
msgid ""
"But they're making all kinds of unreasonable demands, and they won't leave "
"us alone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11880"
msgid "Then let me handle them. I can be very convincing when I need to be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11892"
msgid " I'd... appreciate that, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11904"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11916"
msgid "You have nothing to worry about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11928"
msgid "I'll do something about these goons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11940"
msgid "No. I don't want to have you clean up my mess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11952"
msgid "Thanks anyway..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11964"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11976"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11988"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12000"
msgid "Maybe it's a bit late to ask..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12012"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12024"
msgid "What kind of women do you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12036"
msgid "Heh. That is pretty late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12048"
msgid "Hehe, I know. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12060"
msgid "But seriously, what's your type?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12072"
msgid "You can't tell?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12084"
msgid "Well, you've never mentioned anything like that to me, so how can I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12096"
msgid "Even after I've requested you this much...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12108"
msgid "You should know what kind of woman I'm into by now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12120"
msgid "Wait a minute. Are you saying what I think you're saying?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12132"
msgid "I'm sure you know what I mean."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12144"
msgid ""
"Hehe, so that's what you're into. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> All right. I "
"won't press the issue any further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12156"
msgid "Heh. Maybe that's a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12168"
msgid "Hmm. I do have pretty high standards."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12180"
msgid "Oh yeah? Like what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12192"
msgid "Well... She should have a good tan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12204"
msgid "And nice, long hair, with eyes that twinkle in the light..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12216"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12228"
msgid ""
"Preferably born in Okinawa... Oh, and she can't like shiitake mushrooms. "
"That's the kicker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12240"
msgid "Heyyy! Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12252"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ You are just too sweet sometimes. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12264"
msgid "Heh. Call it what you like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12276"
msgid "Kiryu-san, are you good with kids?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12288"
msgid "Heh. I should hope so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12300"
msgid "Really? You are? Well that's great, 'cause I love kids!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12312"
msgid ""
"Just being around them is special. They're always so happy and full of "
"energy... It's actually a little contagious. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12324"
msgid "Yeah, I'd say so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12336"
msgid "Hey, when you get married, how many kids do you want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12348"
msgid "Just one is enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12360"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12372"
msgid ""
"Let me put it this way. Every life that's brought into the world is "
"precious, so I've never really thought about a number. Raising them up "
"right is the real issue here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12384"
msgid "That's true..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12396"
msgid "Although I will admit, it is kind of funny to imagine you having a kid."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12408"
msgid "...And why is that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12420"
msgid "Oh, nothing... I didn't mean to make you all mad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12432"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12444"
msgid "I want ten at least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12456"
msgid "Wow. That's a huge family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12468"
msgid "Hey, the more the merrier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12480"
msgid "Wouldn't it be a little rough on the wife, though? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12492"
msgid "Then again, maybe that's the fun part. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12504"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12516"
msgid "I'll let nature decide."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12528"
msgid "Haha, that's so like you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12540"
msgid ""
"But you're right. A baby is a gift you're given. You can't just put a "
"quantity and a time frame on them and expect it all to happen the way you "
"planned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12552"
msgid "Right. Sometimes they come on their own time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12564"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12576"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12588"
msgid "You ate rafute today, didn't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12600"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12612"
msgid "You smell like you ate rafute. And don't try to hide it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12624"
msgid "Sorry to disappoint you, but I haven't eaten any."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12636"
msgid "Really? But you have this oily smell all over you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12648"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12660"
msgid "Oh! Maybe it was soki soba?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12672"
msgid "Does it really smell that strong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12684"
msgid ""
"Oh yeah. ♪ Remember, I have an excellent nose, so I have no trouble "
"figuring out whether you just ate or not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12696"
msgid ""
"Oh, and another woman's perfume? Don't even think about trying to hide it "
"from me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12708"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12720"
msgid "I might have eaten some."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12732"
msgid "What do you mean, \"you might have\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12744"
msgid "That's what I said..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12756"
msgid "So, what, are you the type who forgets what they eat or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12768"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12780"
msgid "Or are you the type who makes stuff up to fit the conversation..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12792"
msgid "If you didn't eat any, you could have just said so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12804"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12816"
msgid "That's just my body odor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12828"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ I know it's not your body odor, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12840"
msgid "How can you tell?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12852"
msgid ""
"Because you smell a lot more masculine than a hunk of braised pork. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12864"
msgid ""
"What I'm talking about right now is different. It's kind of a thick, oily "
"smell..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12876"
msgid "Wonder what it is, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12888"
msgid "By the way, I'll know right away if you're cheating on me. The nose knows!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12900"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12912"
msgid "I'd love to go for a dip in an onsen sometime..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12924"
msgid "Are there any nearby?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12936"
msgid "Well, there are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12948"
msgid ""
"But if I'm gonna take a bath somewhere, the atmosphere needs to be quiet "
"and relaxing. So it has to be a ryokan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12960"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12972"
msgid ""
"I want to wash all my worries away in an open-air bath surrounded by "
"nothing but nature..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12984"
msgid "And then fill up on some amazing food..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12996"
msgid "The moment I save up enough money, I'm going. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13008"
msgid "Who are you planning on going with?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13020"
msgid "Oh. That... I haven't decided."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13032"
msgid "I think I'll probably go with one of my girlfriends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13044"
msgid "Gotcha..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13056"
msgid ""
"Oh? Were you worried just now, Kiryu-san? You thought I was maybe taking "
"along some guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13068"
msgid "No, that's not it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13080"
msgid "Oh. Well, that was underwhelming."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13092"
msgid ""
"Anyway. I think it'd be fun to have a little girl time at the onsen. I am "
"way overdue for a nice trip like that."
msgstr ""

